Sorting_quicksort_anim.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"http:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by-sa\/3.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 3.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Working notes on Algorithms: Binary Search Algorithm.<\/h2>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on Algorithms: Binary Search Algorithm.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Binary Search Algorithm<\/h4>\n\t<ol class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Divide into two halves. 2. 1st half \u2014 max: compare with search value. 1. Whether it equal to the data we are looking for. 2. Search value &gt; 1st half \u2014 max 1. Discard the 1st half 2. Continue search in 2nd half 3. Search value &lt; 1st half \u2014 max 1. Discard the 2nd half 2. Continue search in 1st half 3. Continue with step 1.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/algorithms\/binary_search' data-target='computer\/technology\/algorithms\/binary_search' data-title='Binary Search'>\r\n<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt=\"Navigation - link to computer\/technology\/algorithms\/binary_search\"><div class='item_block_text'><div>Binary Search<\/div><\/div><\/a><\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/algorithms\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/algorithms\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"smal